 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "acceptance US12 30-2§3 Repeater: states (3.1): 64 states, defaults facing north, delay 1, locked false, powered false" TO TL-CASE
     PERFORM BEGIN-CASE
     MOVE "0" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "RS1-REP-STATES" USING WS-R1 WS-R2 WS-R3 WS-R4 WS-R5
     MOVE 5 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "64/2/1/0/0" TO TL-EXPECTED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE "acceptance US12 30-2§3 Repeater: timing (3.2): getDelay is delay * 2 game ticks, output 15" TO TL-CASE
     PERFORM BEGIN-CASE
     MOVE "1" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "RS1-REP-DELAY" USING WS-I1 WS-R1 WS-R2
     MOVE 2 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "2" TO WS-IN
