     MOVE "acceptance US12 30-2§3 Repeater: locking (3.4): a side diode contributes its output only when its facing equals the direction from the repeater to it and it is powered (E4: X facing E locks, Y" TO TL-CASE
     PERFORM BEGIN-CASE
     MOVE "5 5 1 1 15" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "RS1-REP-LOCK-SIDE" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-I5 WS-R1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "5 4 1 1 15" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "RS1-REP-LOCK-SIDE" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-I5 WS-R1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "5 5 0 1 15" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "RS1-REP-LOCK-SIDE" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-I5 WS-R1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
