     MOVE "acceptance US12 30-2§3 Repeater: updateShape (3.5): air when the block below cannot support (0); on a server a side neighbour (axis differs from facing) re-computes locked (1); otherwise" TO TL-CASE
     PERFORM BEGIN-CASE
     MOVE "0 2 0 1" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "RS1-REP-SU" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-R1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "0 2 1 1" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "RS1-REP-SU" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-R1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "5 2 1 1" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
